<title>HONG KONG: Jinhui 1996 net profit eases slightly.</title>
<headline>Jinhui 1996 net profit eases slightly.</headline>
<dateline>HONG KONG 1997-04-10</dateline>
<text>
<p>Year ended December 31</p>
<p>(in million HK$ unless stated)</p>
<p>    Shr (H.K. cents)	   10.0	 vs 10.0</p>
<p>    Dividend (H.K. cents)    nil	  vs nil</p>
<p>    Exceptional items	  45.28 gain vs 6.23 loss</p>
<p>    Net			    52.42	vs 52.74</p>
<p>    Turnover		     2,053.41   vs 2,632.79</p>
<p>    Company name		 Jinhui Holdings Co Ltd</p>
<p>    Books close		  N/A</p>
<p>    Dividend payable	   N/A</p>
<p>NOTE - Jinhui is a provider of shipping agency, feeder, lighterage and warehousing services.</p>
<p>The company said exceptional gain was mainly from sale of interest in subsidiary companies and associated companies.</p>
<p>Total dividend for the year is four H.K. cents (including interim dividend of four cents) vs two cents.</p>
<p>-- Hong Kong newsroom (852) 2843 6368</p>
</text>
